{"id": "sevt_01FwBn7w67rUntqWCpaGdi1F", "content": [{"text": "Clear picture forming. The p99 has **two phases**:\n- **Gradual ramp starting exactly at 14:06** (68\u2192412ms over 14:06\u201314:28) \u2014 lines up with deploy `371dfe2` at 14:06:20.\n- **Sharp knee at 14:29** (412\u21922152\u2192~4000ms) \u2014 the \"spike\" you saw.\n\nThe diff for `371dfe2` is a textbook N+1: it replaced a single batched `OrderItem.objects.filter(order_id__in=ids)` with a **per-row query inside a loop** \u2014 the #1 thing on the runbook's \"burned us\" list. The cache-disable (`db46df5`) was rolled back at 14:23:40, well before the knee, and left no visible step in p99 \u2192 red herring.\n\nLet me confirm against the log (the diff helpfully added a per-row query log line) and check the DB pool to explain the 14:29 knee.", "type": "text"}], "processed_at": "2026-10-14T05:37:22.430505Z", "type": "agent.message"}
